{"base":"30fb87ca055beb5997ab3f28d02bbc7866e8b683","body":"Same process as last time: https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/43598\r\n\r\nThis upgrades xunit to the latest 2.9.0 version, matching what we use in arcade.\r\n\r\nNew xunit analyzers caught a lot of issues in the tests, those are now fixed. I recommend reviewing commit by commit.\r\nSome warnings were suppressed where it made sense to me but please double check.","head":"f930b176cbd0945f4a7df27099d5e5796baeb230","html_url":"https://github.com/dotnet/aspnetcore/pull/57303","merged_at":"2024-08-23T17:27:53Z","number":57303,"state":"closed","title":"Upgrade xunit version to 2.9.0"}
